# REQUIREMENTS: cu-003

Introduce the external-configuration loader and delete the classpath configuration. User configuration must not be part of the compiled artifact, so src/main/resources/application.conf leaves both trees and conf/ at the repository root becomes the single source. Discovery is walk-up from the working directory with no environment override, because run / fork := true makes the working directory the launch directory, which is pipelines/ingestion rather than the repository root. A hardcoded relative path would therefore resolve to nothing.
